### 1. 根据用户名查询用户
GET {{prefix}}/test/user/findByUserName?userName=013200030931
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.1 模糊查询用户列表
POST {{prefix}}/test/user/findByFuzzy
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": "14362174457851904",
  "disableState": "N",
  "userName": "309",
  "userDescription": "李",
  "montage": "and"
}

### 2.2 模糊查询用户列表
POST {{prefix}}/test/user/findByFuzzyAndDept
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

